{#
    One person to ring, the way /admin/scans writes it everywhere: the name — a link to the
    resident's card, plain text for the gate's login (it is refused at that card) — and the
    phone as a tel: link for everybody who reads the page (Иван, 12.11.2026). «—» when
    there is nobody. The live passes' «Видав» and every feed line draw it from here, so the
    two cannot write the same person two ways.
#}
{%- if person -%}
    {%- if not guard_only|default(false) -%}<a href="{{ path('app_admin_resident', {id: person.id}) }}" class="text-decoration-none">{{ person.firstName }} {{ person.lastName }}</a>{%- else -%}{{ person.firstName }} {{ person.lastName }}{%- endif %}
    {% set digits = (person.phoneNumber ?? '')|replace({'+': '', ' ': '', '-': '', '(': '', ')': ''}) -%}
    <span class="text-nowrap">({% if digits %}<a href="tel:+{{ digits }}">+{{ digits }}</a>{% else %}—{% endif %})</span>
{%- else -%}
    —
{%- endif -%}
